R> c(cnirl, cnirl) ## error
Error in newCompressedList(class(tls[[1L]]), unlistData, end = partitionEnd,  :
  'unlistData' not of class NormalIRanges

## GappedRanges uses CompressedNormalIRangesList objects at its core
